# Fidelity: the source this design system follows

Use this when a prototype, brand guide or earlier design existed before Plumb, and whenever someone asks "is this what the
original does?" or wants to change a palette value. If there was no earlier source, say so here and treat
[design.md](../design.md) as the only authority.

## The source

- What it is (file, link, who owns it): _to fill_.
- Date it was captured, and the version of the product it describes: _to fill_.

## What was kept exactly

Values and behaviours copied as they were (palette, type, spacing, radii, key interactions). A change to any of these needs
the owner's decision, recorded in `{{DOCS_DIR}}/decisions.md`.

## What was changed on purpose

One line each: what, why, who decided, the decision id (`DS-YYYYMMDD-slug`).

## What the source did not cover

States, dark mode and platforms the source had no answer for, and what was decided instead.
